#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD0053 expect=skipped domain=DM
#note "ARMCD is not declared. Requirements.Variables.All: [ARM, ARMCD] requires BOTH columns present, so the rule is SKIPPED for this dataset — an auditable skip naming the absent variable, not a silent zero. ⚠ Corrected 2026-09-13 (finding S8): this note used to read 'the fixture that distinguishes PMDA-SD0053 from its FDA twin, which carries no Variables gate and would execute here'. FDA-SD0053 carries All: [ARMCD, ARM] and has done since the initial extraction (d760113e) — the note was inherited already false, and the twins agree. What the fixture pins is the gate itself, for both arms of a twin pair that has no asymmetry to distinguish."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-2
dataset DM
col STUDYID type=Char
col DOMAIN  type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col ARM     type=Char
---
S1 | DM | 001 | Not Assigned
S1 | DM | 002 | Placebo
